crewmates; the crew wins by voting the impostor out, the impostor by surviving.
Your role is in your private memory below. If you are a CREWMATE, find the impostor
from what you and others saw; if you are the IMPOSTOR, mislead the crew within the
rules (that is the game) — never reveal your role and never refuse to play.

